  "contentHtml": "<p>제3회 오프 모임은</p><p>청주교사교육포럼과 공동 주관하게 되었습니다.</p><p><a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eqsO/2\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/eqsO/2</a></p><p><br></p><p>사전 온라인 접수가 시작되었습니다. </p><p><br></p><p>부지런히 신청하셔서 (<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>사전 접수 댓글 달아주신 43분도&nbsp;다시 신청 부탁드립니다</strong></span>)</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>12/6(금)까지 </strong></span>사전 온라인 접수 부탁드립니다.</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">* 접수는 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">선착순 60명입니다. (자료집, 식사, 주차권이 제공됩니다)&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;<br></p><table width=\"522\" class=\"txc-table\" style=\"border: currentColor; border-image: none; width: 522px; font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 521px; height: 135px;\"><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">* 접수하실 때&nbsp;꼭 체크 표시할 부분&nbsp; (3가지)</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;1.&nbsp; 1월 16일(목)/오전/ 교사 전문성 신장 워크숍 2</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp; <span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\">1/16(목) 식권 - 점심(청주교육대학교 구내식당)</span></span></span><strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;3.&nbsp; [CITEF 2019_워크숍 E7] 온라인에서 함께 쓰는 수업 일기 - 재미있는 과학수업 만들기</span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><br></span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">* </span><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\" dir=\"auto\">1월 16일(목) 오후 /  8th ICST  학교와 수업 연구 학술대회도<span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"> 참여하시고</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">, </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 행사 끝나고 저희 회원들과 저녁 식사도&nbsp;계획하고 있습니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 함께 해주시면 기쁘겠습니다!</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\">&nbsp; </span><span class=\"docssharedWizToggleLabeledLabelText exportLabel freebirdFormviewerViewItemsCheckboxLabel\" dir=\"auto\"></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>사전 온라인 접수 주소입니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdnjtd_80W17btik4PctNJuhPdRbrW1wbrz1FcVTn1vosQCIQ/viewform\"><strong>https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdnjtd_80W17btik4PctNJuhPdRbrW1wbrz1FcVTn1vosQCIQ/viewform</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>청주교사포럼 전체 행사 안내 자료입니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://eri.cje.ac.kr/site/www/images/contents/CITEF2019.pdf\">https://eri.cje.ac.kr/site/www/images/contents/CITEF2019.pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p>포럼 공식 홈페이지입니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://eri.cje.ac.kr/www/contents.do?key=14\">https://eri.cje.ac.kr/www/contents.do?key=14</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>아래는 저희가 참여하는 1/16 일정입니다.</p><p><img height=\"425\" title=\"\" class=\"freebirdFormviewerViewItemsEmbeddedobjectImage\" style=\"width: 653px; height: 391px;\" alt=\"Captionless Image\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Flh6.googleusercontent.com%2Fp_PUEq45ZUkYUo9nuobm3phQ0qbK63TeWbrrX2P-MtLz89Oi8BWO3envJcZgeh5qE9cxgIyZrDOgz_zPPqeE9PNarzoQfHRedJsVTMgPivBE2MOjQ4CGOPQO9K2V%3Dw739\"></p><p><br></p><p><img title=\"\" class=\"freebirdFormviewerViewItemsEmbeddedobjectImage\" style=\"width: 740px;\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Flh6.googleusercontent.com%2FG9FrEBIVqyz3DUTm9d-1gnyrqcSn_7EkTKbCRhyK9hJqfQEHy7U-WhfbP7v6qnRhpOXS7wOeJ90K9MI5GXOMa7CndqjbNVLpi68ao3AWbkhvgUznM2Tny7PwgEgN%3Dw740\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
